{"title": "Infernal gem", "pageid": 55265, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Infernal_gem", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">       </p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><div class=\"pi-media-collection\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<ul class=\"pi-media-collection-tabs\">\n\t\t<li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing current\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-1\">In-game</li><li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-2\">In-game (Active)</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content current\" id=\"pi-tab-1\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Inert_Infernal_Gem_Item.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"In-game\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Inert_Infernal_Gem_Item.png/300px-Inert_Infernal_Gem_Item.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Inert_Infernal_Gem_Item.png/300px-Inert_Infernal_Gem_Item.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Inert_Infernal_Gem_Item.png/600px-Inert_Infernal_Gem_Item.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"In-game\" width=\"270\" height=\"231\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content\" id=\"pi-tab-2\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Infernal_Control_Gem.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"In-game (Active)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Infernal_Control_Gem.png/300px-Infernal_Control_Gem.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Infernal_Control_Gem.png/300px-Infernal_Control_Gem.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Infernal_Control_Gem.png/600px-Infernal_Control_Gem.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"In-game (Active)\" width=\"270\" height=\"218\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div></aside>\n<b>Infernal Gem</b> is a kind of environmental object in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It serves as a door lock for <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope#Raphael's_Vault\" title=\"House of Hope\">Raphael's Vault</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Infernal Gem is inside the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"House of Hope\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a>, directly south of the entrance to the Boudoir. It bars entrance to Raphael's Vault.\n</p><p>Passing a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Perception Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> is needed to spot the gem. Named <i>\"Inert Infernal Gem\"</i>, it can be interacted with, causing the party member to roll a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Wisdom Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>. If successful the gem starts glowing and is renamed <i>\"Infernal Control Gem\"</i>. Interacting with it again causes a roll for a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;20 Arcana Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;20 <a href=\"/wiki/Arcana\" title=\"Arcana\">Arcana</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>. If successful the gem dissappears and the door behind it opens, allowing access to Raphael's Vault.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715000618\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3718/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35251/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14977/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1739/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1074531/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   84.207      1 -total\n 82.81%   69.729      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 43.91%   36.977      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 35.08%   29.537      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.42%   10.461      1 Template:Template_style\n 10.82%    9.111      4 Template:Icon_text\n  9.41%    7.926     21 Template:Trim\n  7.96%    6.700      3 Template:Ability_Check\n  7.37%    6.205     52 Template:Plus_if_pos\n  4.90%    4.125      2 Template:Credits\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:55265-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715000618 and revision id 401531. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}